  ('Bali MMA','https://www.balimma.com/','Indonesia','Bali - Canggu',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/balimma/',null,'https://www.balimma.com/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bali%20MMA%20Canggu','1','MMA, martial arts, strength and conditioning, fight camp','Booking/contact tools visible; dedicated accountability app unknown','Complement athlete and transformation coaching',8,7,8,7,7,9,7,'Warm','I came across Bali MMA and liked the international fight-camp style community and performance-focused training.','Ascend fits for serious members who need nutrition, weight, workouts and recovery tracked between coaching sessions.','Fight prep accountability, weight management, recovery and coach visibility.','May prioritize martial arts systems; may need proof Ascend is not a generic fitness tracker.','Position Ascend around athlete accountability and evidence-based coach check-ins.',array['https://www.balimma.com/','https://www.instagram.com/balimma/']::text[]),
  ('Power + Revive Studio','https://www.powerandrevive.studio/','Indonesia','Bali - Canggu',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/powerandrevive/',null,'https://www.powerandrevive.studio/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Power%20and%20Revive%20Studio%20Canggu','1','Strength, mobility, recovery, fitness trainer academy','Academy/contact tools visible; dedicated accountability app unknown','Complement coaching education and member accountability',7,7,8,7,8,9,7,'Warm','I came across Power + Revive Studio and liked the strength, recovery and trainer-education angle in Canggu.','Ascend fits because it can help trainers apply accountability habits with real clients and make progress easier to review.','Trainer/client follow-up, habit coaching, nutrition consistency and education-led retention.','May be more education/studio than gym; may prefer hands-on coaching tools.','Position Ascend as practical infrastructure for trainers to manage between-session accountability.',array['https://www.powerandrevive.studio/','https://www.powerandrevive.studio/fitness-trainer-academy']::text[]),
  ('Bali Fitness Seminyak','https://www.balifitness.asia/','Indonesia','Bali - Seminyak','bfs@balifitness.asia',null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/balifitnessseminyak/',null,'https://www.balifitness.asia/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bali%20Fitness%20Seminyak','1','Boutique gym, Les Mills, cycle, weights, personal training','Website/contact tools visible; dedicated app unknown','Complement PT and class engagement',7,6,7,7,8,8,7,'Warm','I came across Bali Fitness Seminyak and liked the boutique gym and group-class focus with personal training available.','Ascend fits if the team wants to improve follow-up for PT and transformation members beyond class attendance.','Nutrition consistency, trainer touchpoints, progress tracking and retention.','May be more class-led than PT-heavy; may not need athlete-level features immediately.','Pitch a simple Premium accountability pilot for PT clients first.',array['https://www.balifitness.asia/']::text[]),
  ('F45 Training One East Surabaya','https://f45training.com/id/studio/oneeastsurabaya/','Indonesia','Surabaya',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/f45_training_oneeast/',null,'https://f45training.com/id/studio/oneeastsurabaya/contact/','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=F45%20Training%20One%20East%20Surabaya','1','Functional training franchise studio','F45 app/ecosystem likely','Complement only as local accountability layer',7,8,8,6,6,8,7,'Warm','I came across F45 Training One East Surabaya and liked the strong functional training community and local studio activity.','Ascend could fit as a local accountability layer for members needing nutrition, hydration and progress support outside class.','Member retention, transformation follow-up and local coach visibility.','F45 already has a strong platform; local owners may have limited autonomy.','Approach as a small local pilot that complements F45 class programming rather than replacing anything.',array['https://f45training.com/id/studio/oneeastsurabaya/new-to-f45/','https://www.instagram.com/f45_training_oneeast/']::text[]),
  ('Atlas Sports Club Surabaya','https://www.atlassportsclub.com/','Indonesia','Surabaya',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/atlassportsclub/',null,'https://www.atlassportsclub.com/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Atlas%20Sports%20Club%20Surabaya','1','Premium sports club, gym, classes, personal training','Club systems likely; dedicated accountability app unknown','Complement PT/member engagement',7,6,8,6,6,7,7,'Warm','I came across Atlas Sports Club and liked the premium full-club positioning in Surabaya.','Ascend fits if the club wants trainers to identify disengaging members and create stronger PT renewal conversations.','Retention, trainer follow-up, PT upsell and member engagement.','Large club operations may slow adoption; may be less boutique than ideal.','Pitch a controlled pilot for selected PT clients rather than a full club rollout.',array['https://www.atlassportsclub.com/','https://www.instagram.com/atlassportsclub/']::text[]),
  ('Urban Athletes Indonesia','https://urbanathletes.co.id/','Indonesia','Surabaya',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/urbanathletesid/',null,'https://urbanathletes.co.id/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Urban%20Athletes%20Surabaya','Multiple','Fitness club, classes, personal training','Club/member systems likely','Complement PT/member retention',7,7,7,6,6,7,7,'Warm','I came across Urban Athletes and liked the active fitness-club model with classes and training options.','Ascend could help selected trainers monitor nutrition, workouts and engagement outside sessions.','Member retention, engagement, PT conversion and follow-up.','May be too broad/mainstream for early pilot; decision speed may be moderate.','Approach with a small trainer-led pilot and clear retention/accountability metrics.',array['https://urbanathletes.co.id/','https://www.instagram.com/urbanathletesid/']::text[]),
  ('MOVE Fitness Bandung','https://www.instagram.com/movefitness.bandung/','Indonesia','Bandung',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/movefitness.bandung/',null,null,'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=MOVE%20Fitness%20Bandung','6','Gym, classes, personal training','Instagram-led; dedicated app unknown','Complement PT and multi-location engagement',7,6,7,7,7,7,7,'Warm','I came across MOVE Fitness Bandung and liked the accessible classes plus personal training positioning across multiple locations.','Ascend fits if the team wants a simple way to identify which members need follow-up and keep PT clients accountable.','Trainer follow-up, consistency tracking, PT retention and member engagement.','May be price-sensitive or operationally simple; public contact data is limited.','Offer a lightweight pilot with one location and selected trainers.',array['https://www.instagram.com/movefitness.bandung/']::text[]),
  ('GymRat Indonesia','https://www.instagram.com/gymrat.id/','Indonesia','Yogyakarta',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/gymrat.id/','https://www.facebook.com/p/Gym-Rat-Indonesia-61565383304635/',null,'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=GymRat%20Indonesia%20Yogyakarta','1','Large gym, HYROX classes, personal trainers','Instagram/social-led; dedicated app unknown','Complement HYROX/PT accountability',7,6,7,7,8,6,7,'Warm','I came across GymRat Jogja and liked the HYROX class push and strong personal trainer presence.','Ascend fits because HYROX and PT members need accountability on training, nutrition and recovery between sessions.','HYROX prep, PT follow-up, nutrition consistency and member retention.','May be more value-focused; public contact details are limited.','Lead with HYROX prep accountability and trainer daily priorities.',array['https://www.instagram.com/gymrat.id/','https://www.facebook.com/p/Gym-Rat-Indonesia-61565383304635/']::text[]),
  ('DR Gym Yogyakarta','https://latihanfisik.com/en/gym-detail/dr-gym/','Indonesia','Yogyakarta',null,null,null,null,null,null,null,'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=DR%20Gym%20Yogyakarta','1','Local gym with personal trainers','Directory listing; dedicated app unknown','Complement only if PT program is structured',6,5,5,5,7,5,5,'Cold','I came across DR Gym Yogyakarta and noticed personal trainers are available for members.','Ascend may fit if the gym wants to formalize PT accountability, but it appears less premium than the strongest early-pilot targets.','Basic PT follow-up and member consistency.','May be budget/local rather than premium; limited public digital presence.','Only approach after stronger boutique leads, or test as a simpler low-cost PT workflow.',array['https://latihanfisik.com/en/gym-detail/dr-gym/']::text[]),
  ('d''GROOVE Sport Center','https://dgroovesports.com/','Indonesia','Bandung',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/dgroovesports/','https://www.facebook.com/dgroovesports/',null,'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=dGROOVE%20Sport%20Center%20Bandung','1','Premium sport and wellness center, gym, classes, HYROX, personal training','Website/WhatsApp-led; dedicated accountability app unknown','Complement PT, HYROX and class engagement',7,7,8,7,7,6,7,'Warm','I came across d''GROOVE Sport Center and liked the premium sportainment positioning, HYROX class activity and free personal trainer offer.','Ascend fits because a large local club with PT, classes and HYROX can use trainer visibility to keep members accountable outside the facility.','PT follow-up, HYROX accountability, class-to-PT conversion, retention and member engagement.','Large facility may have operational complexity; English-friendly fit is less certain than Bali/Jakarta boutiques.','Pitch Ascend as a local-club accountability pilot for HYROX/PT members, not a full platform replacement.',array['https://dgroovesports.com/','https://www.facebook.com/dgroovesports/']::text[]),
  ('Fitness Plus Jogja','https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/branch/FPJGJ','Indonesia','Yogyakarta',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/fitnessplusindonesia/',null,'https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fitness%20Plus%20Jogja','Multiple','Gym, classes, expert trainers','Fitness Plus systems likely','Complement selected PT/member engagement workflows',6,7,6,5,5,6,6,'Cold','I came across Fitness Plus Jogja and noticed the focus on expert trainers and modern facilities.','Ascend may fit as a PT accountability layer, but larger chain structure makes it less likely than boutique pilots.','PT retention, member engagement and consistency tracking.','Chain approval process; possible existing systems; less premium boutique focus.','Keep as a later-stage lead unless a local manager is easy to reach.',array['https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/branch/FPJGJ']::text[]),
  ('Olympus Gym Medan','https://www.instagram.com/olympusgym/','Indonesia','Medan',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/olympusgym/',null,null,'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Olympus%20Gym%20Medan','1','Gym with personal training and functional training signals','Instagram-led; dedicated app unknown','Complement if PT/coaching is organized',6,5,6,5,7,5,6,'Cold','I came across Olympus Gym Medan and noticed functional training and personal training activity in the public social presence.','Ascend could help if the gym wants more structured trainer follow-up and member accountability, but the fit is less proven than Bali/Jakarta boutiques.','PT follow-up, habit consistency and trainer visibility.','Limited public business data; may be more local/value-oriented; English-friendliness uncertain.','Treat as a later outreach lead after validating stronger Bali and Jakarta options.',array['https://www.instagram.com/olympusgym/']::text[]),
  ('Fitness Plus Semarang','https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/','Indonesia','Semarang',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/fitnessplusindonesia/',null,'https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fitness%20Plus%20Semarang','Multiple','Gym, classes, personal training','Fitness Plus systems likely','Complement only for selected PT/member engagement',6,7,6,5,5,6,6,'Cold','I came across Fitness Plus Semarang through the Fitness Plus network and noted the trainer-led club model.','Ascend may fit for selected PT clients, but the chain structure and broader market make it less urgent than boutique gyms.','PT accountability, retention and member consistency.','Chain approval; less boutique; existing systems.','Keep as a lower-priority regional expansion lead.',array['https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/','https://www.instagram.com/fitnessplusindonesia/']::text[]),
  ('Fitness Plus Makassar','https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/','Indonesia','Makassar',null,null,null,null,'https://www.instagram.com/fitnessplusindonesia/',null,'https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/contact','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fitness%20Plus%20Makassar','Multiple','Gym, classes, personal training','Fitness Plus systems likely','Complement only for selected PT/member engagement',6,7,6,5,5,6,6,'Cold','I came across Fitness Plus Makassar through the Fitness Plus network and noted the trainer-led club model.','Ascend may fit for PT accountability in a regional market, but it is lower priority than independent premium boutiques.','PT follow-up, member engagement and progress tracking.','Chain approval; uncertain English-friendly member base; less likely fast pilot.','Keep as a later expansion lead if Fitness Plus becomes interested centrally.',array['https://fitnessplusindonesia.co.id/','https://www.instagram.com/fitnessplusindonesia/']::text[])
),
inserted as (
  insert into founder_leads (
    gym_name,
    website,
    country,
    city,
    public_email,
    contact_person,
    owner_manager_name,
    linkedin_url,
    instagram_url,
    gym_size,
    pt_focus,
    existing_app,
    ai_fit_score,
    status,
    expected_mrr_cents,
    current_mrr_cents,
    source_urls,
    research,
    email_drafts
  )
  select
    gym_name,
    website,
    country,
    city,
    public_email,
    contact_person,
    owner_manager_name,
    linkedin_url,
    instagram_url,
    estimated_locations || ' location(s)',
    gym_type,
    coalesce(existing_app, 'Unknown') || '; Ascend should ' || complement_replace,
    ai_fit_score,
    'Not Contacted',
    0,
    0,
    source_urls,
    jsonb_build_object(
      'gymSummary', why_fit,
      'services', gym_type,
      'communityFocus', case when premium_score >= 8 then 'Strong' else 'Moderate' end,
      'technologyUsed', coalesce(existing_app, 'Unknown'),
      'ptEmphasis', case when pt_score >= 9 then 'Very strong' when pt_score >= 7 then 'Strong' else 'Moderate' end,
      'estimatedSuitability', ai_fit_score,
      'priority', priority,
      'country', country,
      'city', city,
      'contactFormUrl', contact_form_url,
      'facebookUrl', facebook_url,
      'googleMapsUrl', google_maps_url,
      'estimatedLocations', estimated_locations,
      'gymType', gym_type,
      'existingApp', coalesce(existing_app, 'Unknown'),
      'ascendRole', complement_replace,
      'scores', jsonb_build_object(
        'ptFocus', pt_score,
        'technologyAdoption', tech_score,
        'premiumPositioning', premium_score,
        'likelihoodToPilot', pilot_score,
        'decisionSpeed', decision_score,
        'englishFriendly', english_score,
        'overallAscendFit', ai_fit_score
      ),
      'personalizedOpening', intro,
      'whyAscendFits', why_fit,
      'likelyPainPoints', pain_points,
      'likelyObjections', objections,
      'suggestedMeetingAngle', meeting_angle,
      'talkingPoints', jsonb_build_array(intro, why_fit, meeting_angle),
      'objections', jsonb_build_array(objections),
      'bestOutreachAngle', meeting_angle
    ),
    jsonb_build_object(
      'subject', 'Quick idea for ' || gym_name || ' coaching accountability',
      'coldEmail', 'Hi ' || gym_name || ' team,' || chr(10) || chr(10) || intro || ' Ascend helps gyms extend coaching into the other 166 hours of the week, giving trainers visibility into nutrition, workouts, hydration, habits and progress between sessions.' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Why I thought of you: ' || why_fit || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Would you be open to a 15-minute walkthrough to see whether a small pilot would make sense?' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Best,' || chr(10) || 'Fariz',
      'followUp1', 'Hi ' || gym_name || ' team,' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Just checking whether Ascend could be useful for your coaches. The idea is simple: trainers coach in the gym, while Ascend keeps members accountable between sessions and summarizes what matters before the next check-in.' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Would a short demo be worth exploring?',
      'followUp2', 'Hi ' || gym_name || ' team,' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'I will keep this brief. Ascend is not a booking app or another workout database. It is a between-session accountability layer for nutrition, workouts, hydration, progress and trainer visibility.' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'If a small pilot is not relevant right now, no worries at all.',
      'linkedinMessage', 'Hi, I am Fariz, founder of Ascend. ' || intro || ' I think Ascend could help your trainers see what happens between sessions. Open to a short walkthrough?',
      'instagramDm', 'Hi ' || gym_name || ' team, ' || intro || ' I built Ascend to help trainers keep members accountable between sessions. Would a quick demo be useful?'
    )
  from seed
  where not exists (
    select 1
    from founder_leads existing
    where lower(existing.gym_name) = lower(seed.gym_name)
      and coalesce(lower(existing.country), '') = lower(seed.country)
  )
  returning id, gym_name
)
insert into founder_lead_notes (lead_id, note_type, body)
select
  inserted.id,
  'general',
  'Indonesia outreach research seed. Status: Not Contacted. Priority and detailed scores are stored in the lead research JSON. Public emails were only included where visible from public sources; missing emails are intentionally left blank. Review source URLs before outreach.'
from inserted;
